aired differences and intermediate sums could overflow to infinity, including false directional support. Reject nonfinite differences and use math.fsum with statistics.mean fallback on OverflowError, preserving subnormal/cancellation behavior, RNG draws and existing cost semantics.\n\nBase 917d99672e37db59835a8ab23b03c99826b12d78. Original four-path allocation plus explicitly owner-authorized tests/test_history_scientific.py harness fix: isolated child lacked -B and generated bytecode. Actual-child regression reproduces this; add -B only and assert expected platform stderr. Existing numerical assertions and protected native diagnostic source remain unchanged.\n\nValidation: numerical baseline3pass/7fail; fixed10pass0skip. Child regression RED3pass/1fail→GREEN4pass. Fresh final b9c2f24 clone full26 history tests PASS0skip with immutable Grid7a83 reference dependency; committed hosted block exact14tests/rawGit+inventory pre/post both PASS. Historical ff1c full25 functionalPASS but postinventoryFAIL from child pyc is retained, not promoted. New stderr assertion initially exposed CRLF-vs-LF test expectation, corrected to exact platform newline; raw failed result retained. Independent source/numerical reviews found no concrete product defect. Four source contamination negatives refuse before tests.\n\nWindows/Ubuntu hosted results pending; local component evidence is not native, physical, authority, scientific-validity or profitability acceptance. Rollback isolated source/harness changes only; old proofs/logs preserved.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-07T11:23:44Z","updated_at":"2026-11-07T11:40:03Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"20f5d15d5028c598309aa05b8f6e2d834764441b","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"YehorBabenko88:agent7/math-history-statistics-overflow-20261107","ref":"agent7/math-history-statistics-overflow-20261107","repo":{"id":141849